  title "The Shadow-Broker's Confession"
  summary "Auditor Yunjoushong investigates Shadow-Broker Nyla's confession to thirty winters of smuggling and the murder of ice-reader ☽'Ilun the Refracted, which she verifies through courier testimony and compass confirmation. However, Yunjoushong discovers that the Thaw-Paths Medallion—which ☽'Ilun died for reading—reveals a second map showing attack vectors through the Stack's eastern ridge and evidence that Council member Amaang Skael'Compass deliberately dismantled defenses before the Shattered-Spire Assault. Realizing that Nyla's confession was orchestrated to protect Amaang by confessing to lesser crimes under the aurora's judgment while keeping the medallion's damning secrets hidden, Yunjoushong steals the medallion and flees toward authorities outside the Stack rather than report to Amaang."
